# Changelog
All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.0.0/),
and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).

## [Unreleased] - 2026-07-13

### Added
- **Application CRUD — complete REST endpoint set** (`/api/v1/applications`)
  - `GET    /api/v1/applications/{id}`   — Find application by UUID; returns `200` with `Message-header: Application found.` or `404`
  - `PUT    /api/v1/applications/{id}`   — Update name / description / active; `codeName` recalculated automatically; returns `200` or `400` / `404`
  - `DELETE /api/v1/applications/{id}`   — Existence-check then hard delete; returns `200` or `404`
  - `GET    /api/v1/applications?ids=`   — Bulk lookup by comma-separated UUIDs via `findAllById`; returns `200` or `404`
- `ApplicationUpdateRequest` DTO (`api/to/`) — mirrors `ApplicationCreateRequest`
- `ApplicationMessageKey` entries: `APPLICATION_UPDATED`, `APPLICATION_DELETED`
- `ApplicationMessageKeyTest` — enum coverage test (matches pattern of other `*MessageKeyTest` classes)
- **`codeName` auto-derivation** in `ApplicationServiceImpl.create()` and `.update()`:
  - Slugifies `name` to lowercase alphanumeric + `_`, truncated to **8 characters**
  - e.g. `"Backoffice Portal"` → `"backoffi"`
- `@Transactional` on `create`, `update`, and `delete` service methods
- `Message-header` response header on every Application endpoint (success and error paths)
- Input validation in `create` and `update`: null body or blank `name` returns `400` with descriptive header

### Fixed
- `ObjectOptimisticLockingFailureException` on `POST /api/v1/applications` — callers supplying an existing `id` in the request body caused Hibernate to call `merge()` on a detached entity; fix: `application.setId(null)` before mapping, forcing a fresh `INSERT`
- `DataIntegrityViolationException` on `POST /api/v1/applications` — `code_name NOT NULL` constraint violated because `Application` POJO has no `codeName` field and the mapper left it null; fix: auto-derive `codeName` from `name` after mapping
- `RedisConfig` compilation error — `RedisURI.getPassword()` and `RedisURI.getUsername()` were removed in Lettuce `7.5.2`; replaced with `java.net.URI.getUserInfo()` parsing (credentials extracted before `RedisURI.create()` hands control to Lettuce for host/port/database/TLS)

### Changed
- `POST /api/v1/applications` now returns **`201 Created`** instead of `200 OK`
- `ApplicationMessageKey` messages translated from Spanish to English; `APPLICATION_CREATE_ERROR` HTTP code corrected from `404` to `400`
- `ApplicationServiceImpl` response pattern aligned with `ServiceTypeServiceImpl` (inline message constants, `Objects.isNull` guards, `ResponseEntity` builder chain)
- `ApplicationApi` interface: tag changed from `"service"` to `"applications"` to match OpenAPI spec
- `ApplicationController.delete(UUID)` — no longer requires a body; delegates `null` application to service
- Spring Boot upgraded from `3.4.1` to **`4.1.0`** (`spring-boot-starter-parent` BOM)
- Spring Cloud upgraded to **`2025.1.2`** (`spring-cloud.version` property)

### Documentation
- `docs/api/applications.md` — full rewrite: 6 endpoints documented with request/response tables, `Message-header` column, `curl` examples, and error reference
- `docs/api/README.md` — Applications endpoint count updated `2 → 6`; total updated `71 → 75`
- `docs/v1/01-getting-started.md` — Quick Reference table updated with 4 new application rows
- `docs/v1/README.md` — Quick Reference table updated with 4 new application rows
- `docs/v1/04-application-client.md` — full rewrite: 6 endpoint sections each with colored Mermaid sequence diagrams; `codeName` derivation rule documented; `Message-header` on every operation
- `docs/v1/10-api-reference.md` — Applications section updated with 6-row endpoint table, `ApplicationUpdateRequest` body, and `Application` response field reference
- All Mermaid diagrams use a consistent color scheme: emerald for Application nodes, blue for Client, amber for roles/warnings, purple for PostgreSQL; sequence `rect` blocks: light-blue for requests, light-green for success, light-yellow for 404, light-red for 400/401

### Added
- Management Client Authentication Manager (MCAM) — M2M OAuth2 client credential lifecycle
  - POST   /api/v1/managed-clients              — Register managed client (returns secret once)
  - GET    /api/v1/managed-clients              — List clients (paginated, filterable)
  - GET    /api/v1/managed-clients/{clientId}   — Get client detail (no secret fields)
  - PUT    /api/v1/managed-clients/{clientId}   — Update client metadata (partial update)
  - DELETE /api/v1/managed-clients/{clientId}   — Delete client + revoke all tokens
  - POST   /api/v1/managed-clients/token        — Issue M2M access token (public endpoint)
  - POST   /api/v1/managed-clients/{clientId}/rotate-secret — Rotate client secret
  - DELETE /api/v1/managed-clients/{clientId}/tokens        — Revoke all active tokens
  - POST   /api/v1/managed-clients/introspect   — Introspect M2M token (public endpoint)
- Flyway migrations V2 (managed_client), V3 (managed_client_audit_event), V4 (audit_event CHECK extension)
- ManagedClientTokenFilter — RS256 M2M JWT validation registered before SessionJwtAuthenticationFilter
- AuditEventType extended with 9 additive M2M event type constants
- ManagementAuthenticatorProperties extended: tokenTtlSeconds, rotationGracePeriodSeconds, rateLimitRpm
- ManagedClientMaintenanceService — scheduled cleanup of stale prevSecretHash values

### Security
- client_secret BCrypt-hashed at strength >= 12; plaintext never logged or persisted
- Constant-time secret comparison via BCryptPasswordEncoder.matches() (AC-TOK-02)
- All key material injected via environment variables — no hardcoded secrets
- Secret rotation grace period enforced via Redis TTL (mcam:grace:{clientId})
- Per-client rate limiting on token issuance (mcam:ratelimit:{clientId})
- Token revocation via Redis tombstone pattern (mcam:revoked:{jti})

### Previously Added
- Created `AuthKey` enum to represent the authentication keys.
- Created `MapperAppConfig` interface for Mapper configuration.
- Created `SessionController`, `SessionRequest`, and `SessionResponse` classes for the session API operations.
- Created `SessionService` interface and `SessionServiceImpl` class.
- Created `CHANGELOG`.

### Changed
- Refactored `enums` package to `constant` package.
- Refactored `RolMessageKey` to `RoleMessageKey` enum.
- Updated Spring Boot from 3.3.4 to 3.3.5.
